.TH CANDLEWIN 5 "November 2026" "candlewin" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
candlewin.ini \- settings of candlewin
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B %APPDATA%\\candlewin\\candlewin.ini
is a Windows INI file that the program writes when the window is moved and at exit.  It can be edited while the program is not running.
.SS [candlewin]
.TP
.B server
.I HOST:PORT
of the candled server (default localhost:8766).
.TP
.B pair
the coin shown (default BTC).
.TP
.B tf
the timeframe: 1m 3m 5m 15m 30m 1h 4h 1d or 1w (default 5m).
.TP
.B scale
the size of the window in percent (75 to 400, default 100 = 300 by 175 pixels).
.TP
.B x, y
the position of the window on the screen (the top left corner of the screen the first time, and whenever the saved place is not wholly on a screen).
.TP
.B bollinger, ma9, ma200
1 or 0: whether each indicator is drawn (default 1).
.SS [positions]
One line for each coin that has a position:
.I NAME=ENTRY,SIZE
with the entry price and the size in coins (negative for a short), for example
.BR BTC=61000,0.5 .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR candlewin (1),
.BR candled (8)
